    "title": "Skyline hours extended for this year's Megabon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeremiah Estrada ,\n2 hours ago PEARL CITY, Hawaiʻi (Island News) -- The Skyline will have extended hours of operation on Saturday for the Meganbon at Leeward Community College (LCC). The Skyline will be temporarily extended to run from 8 a.m. to 10:30 p.m. on Saturday, Sept. 13 for Megabon which is from 3:45 p.m. to 9 p.m. This year’s event will take place at LCC due to the demolition of Aloha Stadium. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
